   dropped by index matching: S7-D16 at (-125.0, -31.0) mm (L-STG); numbered S7-D18 in Experiment08
   dropped by index matching: S8-D17 at (125.0, -31.0) mm (R-STG); numbered S8-D19 in Experiment08
   -> index matching silently drops the superior temporal channels: the only
      auditory-cortex coverage in an auditory-attention task. build_dataset_v2.py
      --by-position recovers them (data_v2_30ch/).

